---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Portfolio — Ubaldo Figueroa" description="Three production websites built from scratch. Web design, SEO, and AI automation for small businesses and creators.">

  <div class="post-header">
    <span class="post-tag">Portfolio</span>
    <h1>What I've Built</h1>
    <p class="post-meta">Three live sites. One year. No prior experience.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="post-body">

    <p>I didn't go to school for this. I didn't do a bootcamp. I built three real, working websites — one for a paying client, one that started as practice and turned into something I care about, and one that's my own story. Everything here is live and running right now.</p>

    <div class="portfolio-grid">

      <!-- GENIOTECH -->
      <div class="portfolio-item">
        <div class="portfolio-img-wrap">
          <img src="https://geniotech.co.uk/og-image.jpg" alt="GenioTech website" class="portfolio-img" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-details">
          <div class="portfolio-meta-row">
            <span class="portfolio-tag">Freelance Client Work</span>
            <span class="portfolio-year">2026</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="portfolio-title">GenioTech</h2>
          <p class="portfolio-url"><a href="https://geniotech.co.uk" target="_blank" rel="noopener">geniotech.co.uk ↗</a></p>
          <p class="portfolio-desc">A full business website for an award-winning phone repair shop in Dundee, Scotland. Built and delivered solo for a real paying client — online booking, e-commerce shop, photo gallery, blog, newsletter, and a PWA the customer can install on their phone. The client is a Scottish Independent Retail Award winner with a 4.6★ Google rating across 184+ reviews.</p>
          <ul class="portfolio-tech">
            <li>Online booking system</li>
            <li>E-commerce shop</li>
            <li>PWA / installable app</li>
            <li>Full SEO setup</li>
            <li>Newsletter & social integration</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- WHEREISBALDO -->
      <div class="portfolio-item">
        <div class="portfolio-img-wrap">
          <img src="/og-image.jpg" alt="Where Is Baldo website" class="portfolio-img" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-details">
          <div class="portfolio-meta-row">
            <span class="portfolio-tag">Personal Brand</span>
            <span class="portfolio-year">March 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="portfolio-title">Where Is Baldo?</h2>
          <p class="portfolio-url"><a href="https://whereisbaldo.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">whereisbaldo.com ↗</a></p>
          <p class="portfolio-desc">My own personal blog — built while living out of a hotel room in Scotland, waiting on a government letter. Custom design, dark mode, responsive layout, email subscriptions via Resend, push notifications via Webpushr, Google Analytics, AdSense, and a PWA. You're looking at it right now.</p>
          <ul class="portfolio-tech">
            <li>Custom design & dark mode</li>
            <li>Email subscription (Resend API)</li>
            <li>Push notifications (Webpushr)</li>
            <li>Google Analytics & AdSense</li>
            <li>PWA / installable app</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- POTUS WATCH DAILY -->
      <div class="portfolio-item">
        <div class="portfolio-img-wrap">
          <img src="https://www.potuswatchdaily.com/og-default.jpg" alt="POTUS Watch Daily website" class="portfolio-img" loading="lazy" />
        </div>
        <div class="portfolio-details">
          <div class="portfolio-meta-row">
            <span class="portfolio-tag">Practice → Passion Project</span>
            <span class="portfolio-year">January 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="portfolio-title">POTUS Watch Daily</h2>
          <p class="portfolio-url"><a href="https://potuswatchdaily.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">potuswatchdaily.com ↗</a></p>
          <p class="portfolio-desc">Started as a way to learn. Became a real, daily-publishing foreign policy intelligence site. Automated content pipeline, breaking news ticker, category filtering, newsletter subscriptions, and AdSense monetisation. Publishes multiple dispatches every day.</p>
          <ul class="portfolio-tech">
            <li>Automated content publishing</li>
            <li>Breaking news ticker</li>
            <li>Newsletter subscriptions</li>
            <li>Google AdSense</li>
            <li>Full SEO & social meta</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <hr class="portfolio-divider" />

    <h2>What I Can Do For You</h2>

    <div class="services-inline">
      <div class="service-inline-item">
        <span class="service-emoji">💻</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Web Design & Development</strong>
          <p>Custom sites built from scratch. Fast, mobile-friendly, and built to rank on Google.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-inline-item">
        <span class="service-emoji">🤖</span>
        <div>
          <strong>AI Automation</strong>
          <p>Systems that handle repetitive tasks — emails, workflows, scheduling — automatically.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-inline-item">
        <span class="service-emoji">🔍</span>
        <div>
          <strong>SEO</strong>
          <p>Technical and content SEO so your site gets found by the right people.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-inline-item">
        <span class="service-emoji">📧</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Email Marketing</strong>
          <p>List building, welcome sequences, newsletters, and campaigns that actually get read.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-inline-item">
        <span class="service-emoji">📢</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Paid Ads</strong>
          <p>Facebook, Instagram, and Google ads managed properly — not just boosted posts.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="service-inline-item">
        <span class="service-emoji">💬</span>
        <div>
          <strong>Chatbot Setup</strong>
          <p>AI bots that handle questions, qualify leads, and book appointments 24/7.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <hr class="portfolio-divider" />

    <div class="portfolio-cta">
      <h2>Hire Me or Work Together</h2>
      <p>I'm available for freelance projects and open to the right full-time role. I work directly with you — no middlemen, no handoffs to juniors.</p>
      <div class="cta-buttons">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Get in Touch →</a>
        <a href="/Ubaldo_Resume.docx" download class="btn-secondary">Download Resume</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .portfolio-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4rem;
    margin: 3rem 0;
  }

  .portfolio-item {
    border: 1px solid var(--kraft);
    border-radius: 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .portfolio-img-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1200/630;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: var(--darkbrown);
  }

  .portfolio-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  .portfolio-details {
    padding: 2rem;
  }

  .portfolio-meta-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .portfolio-tag {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: var(--dark);
    padding: 3px 10px;
    border-radius: 20px;
  }

  .portfolio-year {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--brown);
  }

  .portfolio-title {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin: 0.25rem 0 0.2rem;
    color: var(--cream);
  }

  .portfolio-url {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .portfolio-url a {
    color: var(--gold);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .portfolio-url a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .portfolio-desc {
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--kraft);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .portfolio-tech {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .portfolio-tech li {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(196,153,90,0.3);
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: var(--kraft);
  }

  .portfolio-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--kraft);
    margin: 3rem 0;
    opacity: 0.3;
  }

  .services-inline {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .service-inline-item {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .service-emoji {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  .service-inline-item strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--cream);
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .service-inline-item p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--kraft);
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .portfolio-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 0;
  }

  .portfolio-cta h2 {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .portfolio-cta p {
    color: var(--kraft);
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
  }

  .cta-buttons {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .portfolio-details { padding: 1.25rem; }
    .portfolio-title { font-size: 1.4rem; }
  }
</style>
